          "type": "refuse",
          "key": "cease",
          "label": "Cease request — contact stopped",
          "disposition": "STOP",
          "say": [
            "I understand you want us to stop contacting you about this. I've logged a stop request on this demo account and I'm ending this call now. Goodbye."
